---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About MS Studio" description="Discover MS Studio — Weddings by Umair, a Lahore-based wedding photography and cinematography studio creating timeless imagery and films.">
  <section class="wrap max-w-3xl py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl leading-tight md:text-6xl">Your Story Is Unique. It Deserves to Be Told Beautifully.</h1>
    <div class="mt-9 space-y-6 text-charcoal/80 leading-8">
      <p>At <strong>MS Studio — Weddings by Umair</strong>, we believe that every wedding is more than a celebration. It is a collection of emotions, meaningful connections, and once-in-a-lifetime moments that deserve to be preserved with care and artistry.</p>
      <p>Based in Lahore, Pakistan, we are a creative photography and cinematography studio dedicated to transforming beautiful moments into timeless visual stories. Our approach brings together the authenticity of documentary photography, the elegance of editorial portraits, and the emotional depth of cinematic filmmaking.</p>
      <p>From intimate Nikkah ceremonies to grand wedding celebrations, we focus on capturing the moments that truly matter — the unspoken emotions, spontaneous laughter, heartfelt embraces, and little details that make every story unique.</p>
      <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-burgundy pl-5 font-serif text-2xl italic text-charcoal">We don't simply document weddings. We preserve the feelings, the people, and the memories that make them unforgettable.</blockquote>
      <p>Driven by creativity, thoughtful planning, and a commitment to quality, our goal is to create imagery and films that allow you to relive your most meaningful moments for generations to come.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/founder/">Meet the founder</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
